{{Short description|Shinto Shrine on an Island in Saga Prefecture}}{{expand Japanese|田島神社|draft}}
{{Citation style |reason=Mixing of CS1 and CS2}}
{{Infobox religious building
| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]]
