{{Short description|Shinto Shrine on an Island in Saga Prefecture}}{{expand Japanese|田島神社|draft|date=December 2023}}
{{Citation style |reason=Mixing of CS1 and CS2|date=December 2023}}
{{Infobox religious building
| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]]
| image                 = 田島神社全景.jpg
| caption               = View of the shrine from the sea
| map_type              = Japan
