{{Short description|Shinto shrine in Saga Prefecture, Japan}}{{expand Japanese|田島神社|date=December 2023}}
{{Citation style |reason=Mixing of CS1 and CS2|date=December 2023}}
{{Infobox religious building
| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]]
