{{Short description|Shinto shrine in Saga Prefecture, Japan}}{{expand Japanese|topic=cult|田島神社|date=December 2023}}
{{CS1 config|mode=cs2}}
{{Infobox religious building
| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]]
